-	 *	Page 1 - V=P L1 table
-	 *	Page 2 - V=P L2 table
+	 * and all else invalid. With T1SZ=17 the KVA TTBR1 root is an L0 table:
+	 *	Page 1 - V=P L1 table  (TTBR0 root, T0SZ=25)
+	 *	Page 2 - KVA L0 table  (TTBR1 root, T1SZ=17)
 	 *	Page 3 - KVA L1 table
-	 *	Page 4 - KVA L2 table
